<title>INDIA: India Corporation Bank IPO to open on September 24.</title>
<headline>India Corporation Bank IPO to open on September 24.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's state-run Corporation Bank will launch its initial public offering (IPO) of shares on September 24, a bank official told reporters on Monday.</p>
<p>Each share of 10-rupee face value would be sold at 80 rupees, he added.</p>
</text>
